<section class="trust-section" aria-labelledby="trust-title">
  <div class="trust-frame">
    <div class="trust-heading">
      <h2 id="trust-title">Know what you’re<br />trusting to memory.</h2>
      <a class="text-link" href="/privacy-first"><span class="link-label">Understand privacy</span> <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 15 15 5M5 5h10v10" /></svg></a>
    </div>
    <dl class="trust-details">
      <div>
        <dt>Cloud memory &amp; AI</dt>
        <dd>Notes are stored on Memoato’s servers. Note text and relevant context can be sent to AI providers for extraction and recall.</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>Different storage, different features</dt>
        <dd>Encrypted category titles and notes, and local-only category logging, are separate options. They do not encrypt the cloud memory or MCP flow.</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>Access with a defined scope</dt>
        <dd>MCP keys can be limited and revoked. In the Context pilot, accepted claims are checked against access grants and freshness before retrieval.</dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="start-section" aria-labelledby="start-title">
  <div class="start-frame">
    <h2 id="start-title">Choose where to begin.</h2>
    <div class="start-paths">
      <article class="start-path">
        <div class="path-name"><h3>Write your first note</h3><span>Available · Web app</span></div>
        <p>Sign in, open Quick Log in Cloud mode, and write one thing you want to remember.</p>
        <a class="path-link" href="https://app.memoato.com"><span class="link-label">Open Memoato</span> <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 15 15 5M5 5h10v10" /></svg></a>
      </article>
      <article class="start-path">
        <div class="path-name"><h3>Connect an AI client</h3><span>Available · MCP</span></div>
        <p>Create a key with the access you need, then connect a client that supports remote MCP and bearer authentication.</p>
        <a class="path-link" href="/help#connect-mcp"><span class="link-label">MCP setup</span> <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 15 15 5M5 5h10v10" /></svg></a>
      </article>
      <article class="start-path">
        <div class="path-name"><h3>Try project context</h3><span>Pilot · One owner, one workspace</span></div>
        <p>Read-only GitHub and Linear sources, with human review. Contact us to discuss a pilot for your project.</p>
        <a class="path-link" href="mailto:hello@memoato.com?subject=Memoato%20Context%20pilot"><span class="link-label">Ask about the pilot</span> <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 15 15 5M5 5h10v10" /></svg></a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

